        <item>
            <title>0.4.0</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 22:10:59 -0800</pubDate>
            <link>https://github.com/siplay01/local-voice-releases</link>
            <sparkle:version>0.4.0</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.4.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2>Whiskers 0.4.0</h2><p>Transcribe File now makes a report next to the file: who spoke and for how long, words, pace, longest turns and filler words, plus a transcript and subtitles labeled by speaker. It finds any number of speakers and shows each one's voice pitch. OBS recordings (mkv) with separate microphone and computer-sound tracks label you exactly and level a quiet microphone (needs ffmpeg). Also new since 0.3.2: text appears while you still hold the key, better Russian and English detection, a personal dictionary, a simpler menu and an install guide. The app is now called Whiskers.</p>
]]></description>
